        "disease"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 14 Fortitude save</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 day</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Stupefied 1 (3 days)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Stupefied 2 and Slowed 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Paralyzed with spasms (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> death</p>",
